# # /espresso-dt
#
# EKO (Espresso Knowledge Ontology), an OWL 2 ontology for the espresso
# extraction process, developed at Universidad del Cauca, Colombia.
#
# https://w3id.org/espresso-dt              -> EKO core
# https://w3id.org/espresso-dt/acquisition  -> data acquisition module
# https://w3id.org/espresso-dt/simulation   -> simulation module
#
# Each IRI, and its version IRIs (for example /espresso-dt/3.5.0 or
# /espresso-dt/simulation/1.1.4), returns Turtle to clients that ask for
# text/turtle and the HTML documentation otherwise. Only the current
# release is hosted, so version IRIs resolve to it.
#
# Source: https://github.com/Alejandro-OB/metis-espresso
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# José Alejandro Ortega Benavides
# GitHub username: Alejandro-OB

RewriteEngine on

# --- Modules (and their version IRIs) -----------------------------------

RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/turtle
RewriteRule ^(acquisition|simulation)(/[0-9]+(\.[0-9]+)*)?/?$ https://alejandro-ob.github.io/metis-espresso/$1/espresso-$1.ttl [R=303,L]

RewriteRule ^(acquisition|simulation)(/[0-9]+(\.[0-9]+)*)?/?$ https://alejandro-ob.github.io/metis-espresso/$1/ [R=303,L]

# --- Core (and its version IRIs) -----------------------------------------

RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/turtle
RewriteRule ^([0-9]+(\.[0-9]+)*)?/?$ https://alejandro-ob.github.io/metis-espresso/espresso-dt.ttl [R=303,L]

RewriteRule ^([0-9]+(\.[0-9]+)*)?/?$ https://alejandro-ob.github.io/metis-espresso/ [R=303,L]
